# Deliberately present. A Vercel project whose Root Directory has no
# .vercelignore falls back to the one at the repo root
# (https://vercel.com/docs/deployments/vercel-ignore#monorepos). The root one is
# an allowlist for the marketing site that starts with `/*`; inherited here, it
# could strip this project's source out of its own upload.
#
# These are the entries the root file held before it became an allowlist, so
# this project's upload is what it was when it was inheriting them.
unbundle.py
docs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
